OL,3,GNEWSARadio commentator among inductees
OL,4,Ato hall of fame
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former BBC Radio Stoke commentator
OL,7,Fhas become the first non-athlete to be
OL,8,Finducted into a city's Sporting Hall of
OL,9,FFame.
OL,11,FNigel Johnson has now joined the likes
OL,12,Fof darts player Phil 'The Power'
OL,13,FTaylor, footballers Sir Stanley
OL,14,FMatthews CBE and Gordon Banks OBE and
OL,15,Fstrongman Eddie Hall - all sporting
OL,16,Fluminaries of Stoke-on-Trent.
OL,18,F"When I look at all those wonderful
OL,19,Fpeople, I think to myself you're a
OL,20,Flucky man to have joined that," Johnson
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
